on and decision pages. Ask for the current)Tj ET BT/F2+0 10.5 Tf 54 368.525 TD (compensation plan and written offer.)Tj ET BT/F4+0 12 Tf 54 348.35 TD (Inside the kit)Tj ET .333333 .333333 .333333 rg BT/F2+0 9 Tf 54 294.5 TD (Type in the fields using a PDF reader that supports forms, then save a copy. You can also print the kit and)Tj ET BT/F2+0 9 Tf 54 282.35 TD (write by hand.)Tj ET 0 0 0 rg BT/F4+0 11 Tf 54 270.2 TD (How to read the flags)Tj ET BT/F2+0 9.5 Tf 54 250.35 TD (Every answer example is illustrative. A green flag gives you something concrete to verify; it is not a)Tj ET BT/F2+0 9.5 Tf 54 237.525 TD (guarantee. A red flag is a reason to probe, especially when a pattern persists. "I do not know, but I will)Tj ET BT/F2+0 9.5 Tf 54 224.7 TD (find out" is an incomplete answer, not automatically a red flag. Confirm the facts and judge them against)Tj ET BT/F2+0 9.5 Tf 54 211.875 TD (your needs.)Tj ET Q
