g BT/F4+0 8.5 Tf 112 393.725 TD (RED FLAG ANSWER)Tj ET 0 0 0 rg BT/F2+0 10 Tf 112 378.25 TD ("I closed in two weeks," but the deal was already in final procurement and the company)Tj ET BT/F2+0 10 Tf 112 364.75 TD (presents that as a normal new-hire ramp.)Tj ET .266667 .266667 .266667 rg BT/F2+0 9.5 Tf 112 347.25 TD (Why: An inherited late-stage deal is not evidence that a new rep can repeatedly build and)Tj ET BT/F2+0 9.5 Tf 112 334.425 TD (close business that quickly.)Tj ET 0 0 0 rg BT/F4+0 10 Tf 112 310.6 TD (WHAT I HEARD AND WHAT TO VERIFY)Tj ET q .933333 .94902 .988235 rg .803922 .843137 .937255 RG 112.25 250.35 445.5 46.5 re B* Q Q
