 384.925 TD (and what has sold there recently?")Tj ET .266667 .266667 .266667 rg BT/F2+0 9.5 Tf 54 366.75 TD (If the territory is untested, record that as an uncertainty rather than assuming proven demand.)Tj ET 0 0 0 rg BT/F4+0 11 Tf 54 340.925 TD ("The plan is pretty standard.")Tj ET BT/F2+0 10.5 Tf 54 322.075 TD ("Could you send the current plan and walk me through a deal below quota, at quota, and)Tj ET BT/F2+0 10.5 Tf 54 307.9 TD (above quota?")Tj ET .266667 .266667 .266667 rg BT/F2+0 9.5 Tf 54 289.725 TD (If it is not available yet, ask who can provide it and when.)Tj ET 0 0 0 rg BT/F4+0 11 Tf 54 263.9 TD (When two answers conflict)Tj ET BT/F2+0 10.5 Tf 54 245.05 TD ("I may be mixing up two different groups. I heard 70% from the recruiter and 40% from the)Tj ET BT/F2+0 10.5 Tf 54 230.875 TD (team. Are those different periods or different definitions?")Tj ET BT/F2+0 10 Tf 54 209.7 TD (An incomplete answer is something to follow up on. Repeated refusal to clarify a material condition)Tj ET BT/F2+0 10 Tf 54 196.2 TD (is information for your decision.)Tj ET Q
